  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFRC Surge CEA training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFRC CEA sector and Ukraine Operation CEA programme</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The training will be held in Tbilisi - Georgia in May 2023</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To financially supporting the regional training to be held in Georgia in May 2023. Participants in that training will be available for missions</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the number of members of the roster and better cover CEA positions in emergency operations. 
To support the Ikraine operation with a very needed function.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support IFRC in enlarging the Surge CEA roster in Europe. This training is focused in supporting the Ukraine Operation and 50% of vacancies in the traning will be covered with Ukraine / Russian speakers.</narrative>
  </description>
